    @legacyStudentReadingApi path /api/v1/student-reading /api/v1/student-reading/* /api/v1/studentreading /api/v1/studentreading/* /api/student-reading /api/student-reading/* /api/studentreading /api/studentreading/*
    handle @legacyStudentReadingApi {
